# Enforcement reads the versioning stage's per-tree strict flag.
MODULE: StrictFlagsPerStageFlagsCrossed
TARGET: StrictFlagsPerStage
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: enforcement diverts under the other stage's strict flag
PERTURBS: RunEnforcement

--- FIND
       ELSE IF ~tStrictE
--- REPLACE
       ELSE IF ~tStrictV
--- END
